This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/render-invariant-index.sh and scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh,
both of which are this repository's own programs. install.sh ships neither, and it does not
write docs/invariant-index.md, so on a consumer this fixture would resolve no renderer, no
source and no index. Its controlA arm runs `--check` against the real repo root, which on a
consumer tree is a root that has none of the three.

A fixture whose subject is absent cannot fail, and a unit that cannot fail scores as a pass
in the consumer's own suite verdict.

It is also a MUTATION BATTERY: it builds eight throwaway repos per run and edits copies of
the renderer's own source.
